				"language": "javaScript",
				"jsCode": "//@inline lib/definition.js lib/syncPayload.js lib/syncApi.js\nconst input = toSyncWorkflows(\n\t$input.all().map(function (i) {\n\t\treturn i.json;\n\t}),\n);\nconst built = buildCommandList(input.workflows);\nbuilt.skipped = input.skipped.concat(built.skipped);\nbuilt.errors = input.errors.concat(built.errors);\nbuilt.abortMessage = syncAbortMessage(built.errors);\nreturn [{ json: built }];"
